OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FAdditional reporting by ITV News
OL,8,FInvestigations Producer Lili Donlon-
OL,9,FMansbridge
OL,11,FAllegations of physical assault,
OL,12,Fsexual abuse and drug-taking have been
OL,13,Funcovered at an award-winning care
OL,14,Fcompany for adults with learning
OL,15,Fdisabilities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
