OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FAn ITV News investigation into Blue
OL,8,FRibbon Healthcare Group has exposed
OL,9,Fclaims of staff misconduct and neglect
OL,10,Fat multiple care homes and supported
OL,11,Fliving facilities across the North
OL,12,FWest of England.
OL,14,FAt one residential home run by Blue
OL,15,FRibbon, several staff members were
OL,16,Fsuspended, and police were called
OL,17,Fafter they "bench-pressed" a resident
OL,18,Fwith learning disabilities and threw
OL,19,Fhim across the room.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FAt another supported living service,
OL,8,Ftwo staff were investigated for
OL,9,Fsexually abusing a vulnerable resident
OL,10,Fafter they encouraged them to touch
OL,11,Ftheir breasts and buttocks.
OL,13,FMultiple whistleblowers who worked for
OL,14,Fthe company told ITV News residents
OL,15,Fare being seriously neglected in
OL,16,F"filthy" and "dangerous" conditions,
OL,17,Fthey "wouldn't leave a dog in".
OL,26,@xD@AOUxD@HO]xD@NOUxD@XO]yD@FOUyD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/51
