OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FBlue Ribbon, which also runs
OL,8,FForevermore Care and Cade Care, is a
OL,9,Fprivate company which provides
OL,10,Fresidential care and supported living
OL,11,Ffor adults with learning disabilities,
OL,12,Fautism and other mental health
OL,13,Fconditions. It operates across the
OL,14,FNorth West of England.
OL,16,FOver the course of the investigation,
OL,17,FITV News spoke to multiple sources,
OL,18,Fincluding eight people who have worked
OL,19,Ffor Blue Ribbon, and the families of
OL,20,Fseveral Blue Ribbon residents.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FMultiple sources allege that Blue
OL,8,FRibbon staff across different services
OL,9,Fwere negligent in their care of
OL,10,Fvulnerable adults, with carers found
OL,11,Fsleeping while on shift, ignoring
OL,12,Fresidents and at times leaving them
OL,13,Funattended. One carer was found to be
OL,14,Fregularly taking cocaine while on
OL,15,Fshift.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FOne family, whose loved one had
OL,8,Fprofound learning disabilities and
OL,9,Flived in a Blue Ribbon home for more
OL,10,Fthan two years, said they found him
OL,11,Fnaked outside with his feet covered in
OL,12,Fsores in a pool of his own urine,
OL,13,Ffaeces and vomit.
OL,15,FOn another occasion, paramedics were
OL,16,Fcalled because he had developed
OL,17,Ffrostbite.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FWhen approached by ITV News, Blue
OL,8,FRibbon did not deny that any of the
OL,9,Fincidents took place, but said: "Many
OL,10,Fdo not reflect the information
OL,11,Favailable to us or are presented
OL,12,Fwithout important clinical, regulatory
OL,13,For factual context.
OL,15,F"Other concerns relate to historic
OL,16,Fincidents that were thoroughly
OL,17,Finvestigated at the time".
OL,26,@qD@aOUyD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FBlue Ribbon is a private care company,
OL,8,Fbut it is funded by taxpayers through
OL,9,Fcare packages with local councils and
OL,10,FNHS Trusts.
OL,12,FData shared exclusively with ITV News
OL,13,Fby public contracts analysts Tussell
OL,14,Fshows that local authorities and the
OL,15,FNHS Blue Ribbon Healthcare Group has
OL,16,Freceived at least #31 million in
OL,17,Fpublic money through these on care
OL,18,Fpackages since 2020.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FITV News has seen an internal email
OL,8,Fsent in November 2025, in which Blue
OL,9,FRibbon's CEO Charlotte Smith admitted
OL,10,Fher own serious concerns about staff
OL,11,Fand the standard of care at one of
OL,12,FBlue Ribbon's residential services,
OL,13,FWillow Lodge in Accrington.
OL,15,FMs. Smith states that Willow Lodge was
OL,16,Fat "significant risk" of an inadequate
OL,17,Frating by the regulator - the lowest
OL,18,Fcare providers can be given.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FIn her email, Ms. Smith goes on to
OL,8,Fdescribe multiple serious safeguarding
OL,9,Fissues at Willow Lodge.
OL,11,FShe states she found "incident forms"
OL,12,F- legal documents written when a
OL,13,Fvulnerable adult is involved in an
OL,14,Faccident - "strewn all over the
OL,15,Foffice", and a litany of medication
OL,16,Ferrors, including evidence that staff
OL,17,Fwho had been suspended from giving
OL,18,Fmedication were still administering it
OL,19,Fto residents.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FShe described the furniture in the
OL,8,Fcommunal areas as "revolting" and
OL,9,Fwrote that, if the Care Quality
OL,10,FCommission (CQC) was to visit, she
OL,11,Fbelieved Willow Lodge would be "facing
OL,12,Fsignificant enforcement actions".
OL,14,FCare providers in England are
OL,15,Fregulated by the CQC, which has the
OL,16,Fpower to close down, and prosecute
OL,17,Fcompanies where it finds bad care.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FBlue Ribbon told ITV News that Ms
OL,8,FSmith's email demonstrates governance
OL,9,Fin action and that concerns were
OL,10,Fidentified, escalated and addressed
OL,11,Fthrough Blue Ribbon's governance
OL,12,Fprocesses.
OL,14,FITV News has also obtained evidence of
OL,15,Fthe conditions in some of Blue
OL,16,FRibbon's services. One video, taken by
OL,17,Fa former member of staff last year,
OL,18,Fshowed a resident's supported living
OL,19,Fflat filled with rubbish.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FIt showed mould growing in Tupperware
OL,8,Fboxes of food allegedly delivered to
OL,9,Fthe resident by their family. Another
OL,10,Fphoto shows Blue Ribbon staff asleep
OL,11,Fon shift.
OL,13,FRohan, a 21-year-old man with learning
OL,14,Fdisabilities, lived in Blue Ribbon's
OL,15,FMillbrook service in Preston between
OL,16,FAugust 2023 and March 2026.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30516
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FIn a statement responding to ITV News
OL,8,Finvestigation, Lancashire County
OL,9,FCouncil, who commissions Blue Ribbon's
OL,10,Fservices, called our findings
OL,11,F"extremely serious" and said they were
OL,12,F"investigating the quality and safety"
OL,13,Fof the care provider.
OL,15,FAccording to Tussell's data,
OL,16,FLancashire County Council has spent
OL,17,Fover #9m on care contracts with Blue
OL,18,FRibbon since 2020.
OL,20,FThe "no-care" home
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30517
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"I feel like we've lived through a
OL,8,Fnightmare", said Liz, Rohan's mum.
OL,10,FWe met Liz and her partner Ian at
OL,11,Ftheir home in Lancashire. They told us
OL,12,Fwhat happened to their son Rohan.
OL,14,FHe has Kleefsa syndrome, a rare
OL,15,Fgenetic disorder which affects a
OL,16,Fperson's development and
OL,17,Fcommunication. He is almost entirely
OL,18,Fnon-verbal and requires two-to-one
OL,19,Fcare at all times.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30518
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"He's really cheeky. He loves
OL,8,Fchatting, using sign language so he'll
OL,9,Fconstantly ask you for cheese and cake
OL,10,Fand he thinks it's all very funny,"
OL,11,FLiz told us, when we asked what Rohan
OL,12,Fis like.
OL,14,F"One of his characteristics of his
OL,15,Fgenetic condition is that he has a
OL,16,Fhappy disposition. So you can't really
OL,17,Ftell if he's unhappy," she added later.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30519
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FLiz and Ian agreed to talk to us
OL,8,Fbecause they want people to know the
OL,9,Fextent of what their family has been
OL,10,Fthrough over the past few years at
OL,11,FBlue Ribbon.
OL,13,FIan told us when he talks about Blue
OL,14,FRibbon with friends and colleagues, he
OL,15,Fcalls it the "no-care home".
OL,17,FHe said: "There was no care really,
OL,18,Fwas there?"
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30520
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FWhen Rohan first moved into Millbrook,
OL,8,FLiz and Ian were initially hopeful.
OL,9,FRohan's previously placements broke
OL,10,Fdown, and they hoped this could be
OL,11,Fdifferent.
OL,13,FBut almost immediately, they had
OL,14,Fconcerns.
OL,16,F"It looked like a prison," Liz told us.
OL,18,F"It was dreary, it wasn't pleasant,"
OL,19,FIan continued. "The building was
OL,20,Fcrumbling".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G20/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30521
SC,0021
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"The staff really worried me, the way
OL,8,Fthey presented themselves" added Liz.
OL,10,F"There's no other support. We didn't
OL,11,Fwant him to going, but we were told it
OL,12,Fwas the only place available," Ian
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FFrom the day Rohan moved in, Liz and
OL,16,FIan told us, his experience over two
OL,17,Fand a half years at Blue Ribbon was
OL,18,F"appalling".
OL,20,F"Rohan didn't see any daylight for
OL,21,Fseven months," Ian tells us.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G21/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
