OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"He was locked in without going
OL,8,Foutside and only seeing two carers at
OL,9,Fa time," Liz explains.
OL,11,F"You'd get better conditions being in
OL,12,Fprison. At least you'd be able to go
OL,13,Foutside."
OL,15,FBlue Ribbon told ITV News that any
OL,16,Frestrictions placed on Rohan were part
OL,17,Fof a "legally authorised" care plan.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G22/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30523
SC,0023
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FRohan was moved to a "slightly bigger"
OL,8,Fbungalow after seven months in a tiny
OL,9,Fflat but Liz and Ian say he continued
OL,10,Fto be neglected.
OL,12,F"He would lie on the mattress on the
OL,13,Ffloor naked, because nobody encouraged
OL,14,Fhim to put any clothes on," Liz said.
OL,16,F"And apart from that he would go
OL,17,Foutside and walk around in circles in
OL,18,Fhis garden. And that was it, that was
OL,19,Fhis life. And what had he done to
OL,20,Fdeserve that," Liz recalled. "He just
OL,21,Fbasically survived from day-to-day."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G23/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30524
SC,0024
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FLiz told us that carers were unable to
OL,8,Fcommunicate with Rohan, despite her
OL,9,Fbest efforts to share her knowledge of
OL,10,Fher son.
OL,12,F"None of their carers had any specific
OL,13,Ftraining at all. They didn't know any
OL,14,Fsign language, they didn't know any
OL,15,FMakaton. I offered to go down there
OL,16,Fand teach them sign language but they
OL,17,Fstill didn't know any signs," she said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G24/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30525
SC,0025
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FOther family members whose relatives
OL,8,Fhave lived at Blue Ribbon told ITV
OL,9,FNews that staff routinely failed to
OL,10,Fengage or effectively communicate with
OL,11,Ftheir vulnerable loved ones, sometimes
OL,12,Feven leaving them unattended.
OL,14,FBlue Ribbon told ITV News that the
OL,15,Fsuggestion that carers couldn't
OL,16,Fcommunicate with Rohan was false, and
OL,17,Fthat staff received specialist
OL,18,Ftraining to care for people with
OL,19,Fcomplex needs. They said Liz provided
OL,20,Fbespoke guidance to help staff
OL,21,Funderstand Rohan's communication needs.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G25/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30526
SC,0026
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FAt times, Liz said she found her son
OL,8,Fin conditions she said were putting
OL,9,Fhim in danger.
OL,11,F"It could be really dangerous," she
OL,12,Fsaid, as she told us about what
OL,13,Fhappened on one visit to Millbrook.
OL,15,F"One time we turned up, and Rohan was
OL,16,Foutside, he was naked and he was white
OL,17,Fwith cold. His feet were bare on
OL,18,Fconcrete in a puddle, and the puddle
OL,19,Fwas the overflow from a blocked drain."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G26/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30527
SC,0027
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FLiz said she asked the two carers why
OL,8,FRohan had been left like this, and
OL,9,Fwhat was in the murky puddle his feet
OL,10,Fwere in.
OL,12,F"They said that is where Rohan
OL,13,Furinates and vomits," she said. "So he
OL,14,Fhas his feet in water that has urine,
OL,15,Fvomit and faeces floating around in it
OL,16,Fand he has open sores on his feet."
OL,18,FLiz said her anxiety got worse with
OL,19,Fevery weekly visit to her son, but
OL,20,Fthere was no other care provider
OL,21,Favailable.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G27/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30528
SC,0028
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FOn one visit in mid-January, Liz got a
OL,8,Fcall to say that paramedics were at
OL,9,FRohan's home because his toes had
OL,10,Fturned black, and he may have
OL,11,Ffrostbite.
OL,13,FLiz questioned why Rohan had been
OL,14,Foutside without shoes on in winter for
OL,15,Fany period, let alone a period long
OL,16,Fenough for him to get frostbite.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G28/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30529
SC,0029
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FAnother time, Liz and Ian say they
OL,8,Ffound Blue Ribbon staff emptying mop
OL,9,Fbuckets, full of faeces and urine,
OL,10,Finto Rohan's garden, which he would
OL,11,Fthen walk around in bare feet, often
OL,12,Fwith cuts.
OL,14,F"It was so bad, I was worried for his
OL,15,Flife, his mental health, his physical
OL,16,Fhealth, we just didn't know what was
OL,17,Fgoing to happen next," Liz recalls.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G29/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30530
SC,0030
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"They were happy to invoice the
OL,8,F#12,500 a week, #650k a year (for
OL,9,FRohan's care), and post those profits,
OL,10,Fbut spend very little of it on Rohan,"
OL,11,FIan told us.
OL,13,F"They see the residents as a
OL,14,Fcommodity, (it is) a very profit-
OL,15,Fdriven company."
OL,17,FRohan now lives in a new care home in
OL,18,FPreston, where he is happy and healthy.
OL,26,@pD@^pmqD@MpnvD@LpmvD@Rpn
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G30/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30531
SC,0031
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FBut the couple say they want justice `
OL,8,Ffor their family, and for Rohan. "It
OL,9,Freally is time some people are held
OL,10,Faccountable," Ian said.
OL,12,FIn a statement, Blue Ribbon CEO
OL,13,FCharlotte Smith told ITV News: "I want
OL,14,Fto acknowledge the distress
OL,15,Fexperienced by Ms Bailey and her
OL,16,Ffamily. Caring for a loved one with
OL,17,Fcomplex needs can be incredibly
OL,18,Fchallenging, and families place
OL,19,Fenormous trust in those who support
OL,20,Fthem.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G31/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30532
SC,0032
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"I am sorry that Ms Bailey feels we
OL,8,Fdid not always meet her expectations
OL,9,For that she did not always feel heard.
OL,10,FWe never want a family member to feel
OL,11,Funsupported when raising concerns
OL,12,Fabout the care of someone they love.
OL,14,F"Throughout Mr Urrutia-Winship's
OL,15,Fplacement, we sought to maintain open
OL,16,Fand constructive communication with Ms
OL,17,FBailey regarding her son's care and
OL,18,Fwellbeing. Ms Bailey was a frequent
OL,19,Fvisitor to the service and regularly
OL,20,Fengaged with staff and the registered
OL,21,Fmanager.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G32/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30533
SC,0033
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"She was involved in Best Interests
OL,8,Fmeetings and care planning
OL,9,Fdiscussions, and on one occasion a
OL,10,Fsenior manager visited her at home
OL,11,Fspecifically in response to concerns
OL,12,Fshe had raised.
OL,14,F"We recognise that these concerns come
OL,15,Ffrom a mother's desire to ensure the
OL,16,Fbest possible care for her son, and we
OL,17,Frespect the experiences that have
OL,18,Fshaped her views."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G33/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30534
SC,0034
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FMultiple people who worked for Blue
OL,8,FRibbon have told us Rohan's experience
OL,9,Fwas not an isolated one.
OL,11,FShelley Gray joined Blue Ribbon in
OL,12,FJune 2025 as a Quality Improvement
OL,13,FManager. Her role was focused on
OL,14,Foverseeing the improvement of Blue
OL,15,FRibbon's Supported Living services.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G34/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30535
SC,0035
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"I didn't realise how bad it was, but
OL,8,Funfortunately once you are in, you are
OL,9,Fin, and you think you can make it
OL,10,Fbetter. But there is no one place that
OL,11,Fcan make that place better," she told
OL,12,FITV News.
OL,14,FShelley told us that in her first
OL,15,Fmonth at Blue Ribbon, she was given a
OL,16,Fbriefing about some of the residents
OL,17,Fin the service.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G35/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30536
SC,0036
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FShe then learned that a senior staff
OL,8,Fmember was on suspension for
OL,9,Fpsychologically abusing and
OL,10,Fthreatening to physically abuse a
OL,11,Fvulnerable Blue Ribbon resident they
OL,12,Fwere supposed to be caring for.
OL,13,FShelley said she was informed that the
OL,14,Fstaff member had worked with the
OL,15,Fresident for nearly four years prior
OL,16,Fto her suspension.
OL,18,FWhen she started visiting Blue Ribbon
OL,19,FSupported Living services herself, she
OL,20,Fwas shocked by what she found.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G36/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30537
SC,0037
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"There was that many investigations
OL,8,Fhappening at one time, they didn't
OL,9,Fhave enough staff to do the
OL,10,Finvestigations," she said.
OL,12,F"They're not minor things, it's staff
OL,13,Fsleeping, physical abuse, emotional
OL,14,Fabuse, sexual abuse. Paperwork just
OL,15,Fscrewed up in the corner and not even
OL,16,Fcomplemented.
OL,18,F"Filthy conditions, no wallpaper,
OL,19,Fholes in the walls, doors hanging off,
OL,20,Fclothes that don't even fit people."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G37/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30538
SC,0038
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FShelley told of one member of staff
OL,8,Fwho was suspended for using cocaine on
OL,9,Fshift.
OL,11,F"There was cocaine use. One staff
OL,12,Fmember who we eventually got rid of
OL,13,Fwas using cocaine and was being quite
OL,14,Faggressive," she explained.
OL,16,FBlue Ribbon have confirmed to ITV News
OL,17,Fthat as soon as concerns were raised
OL,18,Fin regard to that staff member they
OL,19,Fwere investigated and their employment
OL,20,Fsubsequently terminated.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G38/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30539
SC,0039
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FShelley was working at Blue Ribbon
OL,8,Fwhen staff at Willow Lodge, one of
OL,9,FBlue Ribbon's residential services,
OL,10,Frecorded a video of themselves "bench-
OL,11,Fpressing" and throwing a service user
OL,12,Facross the room.
OL,14,FBlue Ribbon acknowledged that this
OL,15,Fincident significantly below the
OL,16,Fstandards of care, professionalism and
OL,17,Frespect that they expect. They told
OL,18,FITV News that several staff members
OL,19,Finvolved were investigated and later
OL,20,Fdismissed.
OL,26,@rD@`OUsD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G39/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30540
SC,0040
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FIn another incident, a resident
OL,8,Femerged from his room with an
OL,9,Fornamental samurai sword, and
OL,10,Fattempted to attack another resident,
OL,11,Fslicing a hole through a door. Blue
OL,12,FRibbon told us that no one was harmed,
OL,13,Fand that additional risk management
OL,14,Fmeasures were subsequently put in
OL,15,Fplace.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G40/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30541
SC,0041
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"We weren't sleeping at night. We've
OL,8,Fgot children ourselves with a learning
OL,9,Fdisability and just to think that
OL,10,Fyou've got to work with those people,
OL,11,Fand they've got absolutely no values
OL,12,Fwhatsoever," she told ITV News.
OL,14,F"It was soul destroying."
OL,16,FITV News has learned of several other
OL,17,Fincidents involving the conduct of
OL,18,FBlue Ribbon staff.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G41/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30542
SC,0042
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FITV News understands that two staff
OL,8,Fmembers were investigated for sexual
OL,9,Fabuse, after they encouraged a
OL,10,Fresident with learning disabilities to
OL,11,Ftouch them inappropriately on the
OL,12,Fbreast or buttocks.
OL,14,FBlue Ribbon told us that this incident
OL,15,Fwas fully investigated, and
OL,16,Fappropriate action was taken
OL,17,Faccordingly.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G42/51
