CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FOther former staff have told ITV News
OL,8,Fof their concerns over Blue Ribbon's
OL,9,Ffocus on securing the highest-paid
OL,10,Fcare contracts with local councils and
OL,11,Fthe NHS, which involve looking after
OL,12,Fresidents with the most complex needs.
OL,14,FOne former Blue Ribbon employee told
OL,15,Fus he believed Blue Ribbon took on too
OL,16,Fmany of these lucrative contracts
OL,17,Fwithout the capability of caring for
OL,18,Fthe resident because they were
OL,19,Fmotivated by "profit".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G43/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30544
SC,0044
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"It is about the money, and that's all
OL,8,Fit comes down to," he said.
OL,10,FBlue Ribbon told us they didn't accept
OL,11,Fthis characterisation, and that they
OL,12,Fonly accept placements where they are
OL,13,Fsatisfied they can safely meet an
OL,14,Findividual's assessed needs.
OL,16,FThe former employee has worked in care
OL,17,Ffor 20 years, but said Blue Ribbon was
OL,18,F"the worst of the worst".
OL,26,@zD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G44/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30545
SC,0045
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"I've worked in the industry for a
OL,8,Flong time and I've worked in
OL,9,Fchallenging services before, but the
OL,10,Finjuries and the safeguardings that
OL,11,Fwere raised were absolutely
OL,12,Fridiculous. They were just constant,
OL,13,Funexplained bruising."
OL,15,FSome of the supported living
OL,16,Faccommodation, he told us, was
OL,17,F"disgusting".
OL,19,F"I wouldn't even let my dog live in
OL,20,Fit," he said.
OL,26,@uD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G45/51
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
