SC,0046
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785277089
OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"Local authorities, social workers,
OL,8,FLearning Disability nurses - they are
OL,9,Fall concerned. Numerous have raised
OL,10,Fconcerns with me when I was there," he
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FWhen we asked he how they felt about
OL,14,Fthe residents still living at Blue
OL,15,FRibbon, he broke down in tears, saying
OL,16,Fhe still thinks about them.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G46/51
