OL,3,CA sword, cocaine, abuse: Inside
OL,4,C'nightmare' care company for disabled
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"We remain proud of the care provided
OL,8,Facross our services and of the
OL,9,Fdedication shown every day by our
OL,10,Fcolleagues in supporting people with
OL,11,Fcomplex needs to live safe, fulfilling
OL,12,Fand meaningful lives.
OL,14,F"Our services are independently
OL,15,Fregulated, and all services which have
OL,16,Fbeen inspected are currently rated
OL,17,FGood or Outstanding by the Care
OL,18,FQuality Commission.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G50/51
